{
	title: "Mighty Smelting",
	x: -5.0d,
	y: -3.0d,
	text: [
		"See the 'Seared Devices' section of Materials and You for how to assemble a Tinkers' smeltery.",
		"",
		"Once you have a smeltery, you can smelt cobblestone into seared stone and cast it into more seared bricks to expand your smeltery.",
		"",
		"Liquid fuel (usually lava) is inserted into seared tanks/windows/gauges by Right-clicking. Some materials take fluids hotter than lava to smelt, but higher temperatures also cause smelting to go faster. JEI will tell you what fluid and",
		"temperature is needed if your fuel doesn't seem to be melting something. TAIGA (Tinkers' add-on that adds a bunch of new ores and alloys) has some materials that take hotter fuels than lava.",
		"",
		"Warning: Breaking the smeltery controller will void the smeltery's contents! Breaking any other part is safe though."
	],
